{'symbol': 'GPN', 'date': '2023-02-17 09:04:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ACTION REMINDER: THE SCHALL LAW FIRM ENCOURAGES INVESTORS IN GLOBAL PAYMENTS INC. WITH LOSSES OF $100,000 TO CONTACT THE FIRM', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES, CALIFORNIA--(NEWSFILE CORP. - FEBRUARY 17, 2023) - THE SCHALL LAW FIRM, A NATIONAL SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LITIGATION FIRM, REMINDS INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST GLOBAL PAYMENTS INC. ("GLOBAL PAYMENTS" OR "THE COMPANY") (NYSE: GPN) FOR VIOLATIONS OF §§10(B) AND 20(A) OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934 AND RULE 10B-5 PROMULGATED THEREUNDER BY THE U.S. SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION.'}{'symbol': 'GPN', 'date': '2023-02-17 08:15:00', 'title': 'GLOBAL PAYMENTS, INC. CLASS ACTION ALERT: WOLF HALDENSTEIN ADLER FREEMAN & HERZ LLP REMINDS INVESTORS THAT A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS BEEN FILED IN THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE NORTHERN DISTRICT OF GEORGIA ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS', 'text': 'LE AD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE IS APRIL 10, 2023 NEW YORK , FEB. 17, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 WOLF HALDENSTEIN ADLER FREEMAN & HERZ LLP ANNOUNCES THAT A FEDERAL SECURITIES CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS BEEN FILED IN THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE NORTHERN DISTRICT OF GEORGIA BEHALF OF A CLASS CONSISTING OF ALL PERSONS AND ENTITIES OTHER THAN DEFENDANTS THAT PURCHASED GLOBAL PAYMENTS, INC. ("GLOBAL PAYMENTS" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: GPN). BETWEEN OCTOBER 31, 2019 AND OCTOBER 18, 2022, BOTH DATES INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD").'}